[req] tool_call  call_80 subagent({"agent":"designer","background":true,"description":"U1 copilot UI wiring","prompt":"TenderPulseNZ repo (/Users/sean/Desktop/TenderPulseNZ). Phase 3 (§2 wiring gaps) — copilot dashboard UI lane. The dashboard is a bespoke plain-CSS design system (NOT Tailwind) in `src/features/copilot/design/` served via `src/app/(copilot)/` — work strictly inside that system, keep its tokens, spacing, and feel. Server side is settled and committed: middleware fails closed (session required on /dashboard; `/` is public; `/api/cron/:path*` being exempted by a concurrent lane — don't rely on it); `src/features/copilot/server/loaders.ts` derives tenant via `requireOrgId()` and actor via `requireSessionUserId()`; bids actions enforce viewer-read-only + bid_manager/admin HITL role gates returning `{ok:false,error}` unions (no throws to browser); export route/compiler take server-verified `(bidId, format, orgId, actorUserId)`; UI renders raw UUIDs for reviewer fields (\"Approved by <uuid>\"); dashboard falls back to mocks. READ FIRST: `src/app/(copilot)/dashboard/page.tsx` (mock fallbacks ~29–52), `src/features/copilot/ui/app-shell.tsx` (~5, 82 hardcoded mock org name/NZBN), `src/features/copilot/ui/compliance-vault-screen.tsx` (pure static mock from data/mock.ts), `src/features/copilot/server/loaders.ts`, `src/features/auth/actions.ts` (`switchActiveOrganization` implemented, re-validates membership + sets cookie, but NO UI calls it), vault UI files `upload-form.tsx`/`onboarding-form.tsx`/`vault-document-table.tsx` (deprecated `orgId?: string` props retained-but-ignored) and call sites `src/app/(dashboard)/vault/page.tsx` + `src/app/(dashboard)/vault/upload/page.tsx` still passing them, and the drafter screen where reviewer UUIDs render.\n\nImplement:\n1. Remove silent mock fallbacks on the dashboard: empty/failed/no-tenant loads show honest EMPTY / ERROR / no-tenant states (no MOCK_OPPORTUNITIES masking); no-tenant ⇒ clear state with link to /vault onboarding.\n2. Real org entity in app-shell header: org name + NZBN from the `organizations` row (small new loader fn in loaders.ts reading the active org via requireOrgId; server component props down) + org SWITCHER UI listing the user's active memberships (new loader from organization_members) switching via `switchActiveOrganization` (server action form/button). Accessible: labeled control, keyboard operable, current org marked.\n3. Compliance-vault copilot tab: real loader-backed data — read `src/features/vault/server/actions.ts` `listVaultDocuments()` for the real query shape and build a copilot loader returning per-org vault document rows/counts by category; honest empty state + link to /vault.\n4. Drafter HITL surface: wire `lockProposalAction(bidId)` (exists in bids/actions.ts, zero importers) as an explicit \"Lock proposal\" affordance shown when the bid is reviewable per server state; honest disabled/locked presentation once locked; viewer role ⇒ read-only treatment matching server gates. Reviewer/approver UUID fields: display short form (first 8 chars + …) — never fake names.\n5. Remove the deprecated `orgId` props from the three vault UI components AND stop passing them at the call sites (G1 m4 cleanup).\n6. NEW root page `src/app/page.tsx`: minimal PUBLIC landing — product name, one honest sentence, \"Sign in\" (→/login) and \"Open dashboard\" (→/dashboard). No mock data, no tenant assumptions, restrained gov-tool branding, must not pull Tailwind patterns into the bespoke (copilot) system or vice versa.\n7. Keep axe-clean per repo learnings: sidebar `ul[role=tablist]` ⇒ `role=\"presentation\"` on `<li>`; new controls labeled; `.audit-table th scope=col` unchanged; `--muted` contrast unchanged.\n\nCopy: plain grounded wording (\"No opportunities yet — run an ingest\"), no invented claims. WRITE SCOPE: `src/app/(copilot)/**`, `src/features/copilot/**` (ui/data/design — no token changes unless required), `src/features/copilot/server/loaders.ts` (NEW loader fns only; don't alter existing exported behavior), NEW org-switcher component (co-locate in copilot ui or `src/features/auth/ui/`), NEW `src/app/page.tsx`, and for the deprecated-prop deletion ONLY: the three vault UI components + `src/app/(dashboard)/vault/page.tsx` + `src/app/(dashboard)/vault/upload/page.tsx`. Forbidden: `src/middleware.ts`, `src/lib/auth/tenant.ts`, API routes, `src/features/bids/actions.ts`, `src/features/vault/server/**`, `src/services/**`, `deploy/`, `.github/`, docs/, TODO.md, package.json. Concurrent lane is editing `src/services/` + Caddyfile + cron route — stay out. Validation: `npm run typecheck` exit 0; `npm run test` green; `npm run lint` exit 0 (one pre-existing warning acceptable). No commits.\n\nReturn: files changed; what each screen now shows instead of mocks (one line each); loader fns added; a11y notes; validation results."})
