rategy decided in-migration, genesis/backfill + SEV-2 integrity job; NO migration file edited (design note SSP-only per orchestrator amendment).\n4. D4: SSP §1.2a RTO/RPO with EXACTLY: RPO ≤24h; RTO ≤1h DB-only; RTO ≤4h/one-working-day full-host; \"unverified until first restore drill (E-07)\"; no better claims; wal-g deferred; §2.2 cross-ref; AIMS-05 severity RTO mapping; `deploy/README.md` backup section honest + self-contained (a later consolidation folds §4 cron/freshness items — that's expected, not a finding).\n5. D5: honest status vocabulary (Implemented (artifact)/Automated (CI)/Documented only); E-01 \"to be verified\" + `scan-tls.sh` exists and its checks match the memo spec (TLS1.3 only, 1.0/1.1 absent, no RSA kx, HSTS+CSP), executable, offline-authorable; E-07 script-exists/drill-pending (NOT \"script to be produced\"); E-13/E-18/E-19/E-21 = Documented only; E-16 caveat re mock-dashboard/fail-open — NOTE: B2 landed (`bcd025f`, axe now scans /login) and dashboard mock removal is in-flight; flag only if now misleading. AIMS-04 §3.3 artifact state + §3.4 RAG-triad/scoring-regression wording per memo. Golden fixture + runner sanity: run `npx tsx scripts/scoring-golden.ts`; asserts the canonical formula deterministically against `tests/fixtures/scoring-golden.json`; fixture covers cap-at-70 + ≥80 boundary; runner doesn't fake results.\n6. Cross-cutting: Document Control + Revision History bumped on all FIVE docs per AGENTS convention; scorer.ts diff additive-only (`SEMANTIC_WEIGHT`/`CRITERIA_WEIGHT`/`ALERT_THRESHOLD`/`computeCombinedScore`) with byte-identical math; no overreach beyond the memo; deferred-§3 backlog present in TODO.md (verify, don't edit).\n\nDeliverable: verdict APPROVE / APPROVE-WITH-FIXES / BLOCK; MATERIAL/MINOR findings with file:line + exact wrong quote vs memo requirement; plus anything the orchestrator audit could have missed. Out of scope / accepted (don't re-litigate): the D1–D4 decisions themselves; §3 deferrals; evidence artifacts needing live takahe infra. Commits `39215ef` (CI) and `0a35a77` (deploy infra) landed after — out of scope."})
