[req] tool_call  call_194 edit({"newString":"cookies stay first-party. See `deploy/certs/README.md` for the exact files to\nprovision.\n\nServer-side calls to the Supabase gateway resolve **in-network**: the app layer's\nCaddy container carries a network alias for the public origin on the Supabase\ninternal network, so `app.clearpixels.org` lookups from inside the compose\nstacks hit Caddy's container IP directly (embedded DNS takes precedence) and\nnever hairpin out to the public interface. `SUPABASE_URL` stays a\nbrowser-reachable HTTPS origin — the browser URL is unchanged either way.","oldString":"cookies stay first-party. See `deploy/certs/README.md` for the exact files to\nprovision.","path":"/Users/sean/Desktop/TenderPulseNZ/deploy/README.md"})
[req] tool_call  call_195 edit({"newString":"| `certs/`                      | Wildcard edge cert + inference mTLS material (git-ignored).                                                                               |\n| `observability.yml`           | Compose **overlay** (opt-in via `-f`): loopback Caddy admin endpoint, digest-pinned `node_exporter`, log rotation caps.                   |\n| `OBSERVABILITY.md`            | Honest monitoring inventory: what exists, what is unwired, what is absent.                                                                |\n| `scripts/backup-encrypted.sh` | Encrypted nightly DB backup/restore tool (see Backup & restore below).                                                                    |\n| `scripts/backup-cron.sh`      | Non-interactive cron/systemd wrapper for the nightly backup; writes `deploy/state/` success/failure sentinels.                            |\n| `scripts/check-backup-fresh.sh` | Backup-freshness + failure-sentinel probe (exit code is the interim FR-304 alert interface).                                             |\n| `scripts/scan-tls.sh`         | Offline TLS-posture scan of the edge (TLS 1.3-only assertions, HSTS/CSP presence); evidence artifact E-01 runner.                          |","oldString":"| `certs/`                      | Wildcard edge cert + inference mTLS material (git-ignored).                                                                               |"})
[req] tool_call  call_196 edit({"newString":"**Cadence (reality):** execution is still **operator-scheduled** on `takahe` —\nnothing is auto-installed. `deploy/scripts/backup-cron.sh` wraps the backup for\ncron/systemd (alternatives documented in its header) and records sentinels in\ngit-ignored `deploy/state/`: a `BACKUP-LAST-OK` timestamp and a `BACKUP-FAILED`\nmarker on non-zero exit. `deploy/scripts/check-backup-fresh.sh` then verifies\nfreshness (≤ 26 h since last OK) and the absence of a failure sentinel; its\n**exit code is the interim FR-304 backup-failure alert interface** until real\nalerting exists. Until a schedule is installed, the nightly run remains a\nrunbook step, not an automatic guarantee.","oldString":"**Cadence (intent):** nightly execution, operator-scheduled on `takahe`. The\ncron entry and backup-failure alerting are **not yet installed** — until they\nare, the nightly run is a runbook step, not an automatic guarantee.","path":"/Users/sean/Desktop/TenderPulseNZ/deploy/README.md"})
