[req] tool_call  call_199 edit({"newString":"| `certs/`                      | Wildcard edge cert + inference mTLS material (git-ignored).                                                                               |\n| `observability.yml`           | Compose **overlay** (opt-in via `-f`): loopback Caddy admin endpoint, digest-pinned `node_exporter`, log rotation caps.                   |\n| `OBSERVABILITY.md`            | Honest monitoring inventory: what exists, what is unwired, what is absent.                                                                |\n| `scripts/backup-encrypted.sh` | Encrypted nightly DB backup/restore tool (see Backup & restore below).                                                                    |\n| `scripts/backup-cron.sh`      | Non-interactive cron/systemd wrapper for the nightly backup; writes `deploy/state/` success/failure sentinels.                            |\n| `scripts/check-backup-fresh.sh` | Backup-freshness + failure-sentinel probe (exit code is the interim FR-304 alert interface).                                             |\n| `scripts/scan-tls.sh`         | Offline TLS-posture scan of the edge (TLS 1.3-only assertions, HSTS/CSP presence); evidence artifact E-01 runner.                          |","oldString":"| `certs/`                      | Wildcard edge cert + inference mTLS material (git-ignored).                                                                               |","path":"/Users/sean/Desktop/TenderPulseNZ/deploy/README.md"})
[req] tool_call  call_200 edit({"newString":"## Observability\n\nThere is **no metrics/uptime/alerting platform wired** — deliberately recorded\nin `OBSERVABILITY.md` rather than glossed over. What exists:\n\n- `deploy/observability.yml` — an **unwired** Compose overlay (add\n  `-f deploy/observability.yml` to the app compose command): exposes Caddy's\n  admin API on loopback only, adds a digest-pinned `node_exporter` + a `curl`\n  probe container, and caps container log sizes. No scraper consumes the metrics\n  yet.\n- `deploy/scripts/check-backup-fresh.sh` — the only automated health probe\n  (backup freshness; exit-code alerting per FR-304).\n- CI post-deploy smoke (`deploy/scripts/post-deploy-smoke.sh`) — one-shot\n  post-release assertions, not continuous uptime monitoring.\n\nUptime monitoring, metric scraping, and centralized log retention remain\nabsent-by-design until a platform decision is made; see `OBSERVABILITY.md`.\n\n## Sovereignty","oldString":"## Sovereignty","path":"/Users/sean/Desktop/TenderPulseNZ/deploy/README.md"})
