[req] raw model output (9239 chars): "# G2 Gate Review — commit `6e222ef` vs. binding memo `.slim/deepwork/o0-decision-memo.md`\n\n## Verdict: **APPROVE**\n\nZero MATERIAL findings. All binding D1–D5 edits are present, correctly worded, in the correct locations, with no overclaims introduced and no migration/scorer math touched. Five MINOR follow-ups + two audit-gap notes below — none blocks the phase gate.\n\n---\n\n## Decision-by-decision fidelity (all ✅)\n\n**D1 — Scoring: amend FRD to code ✅**\n- FRD `:1106-1111`: canonical `combinedScore = round(100 × (0.7·semantic_fit + 0.3·criteria_factor))` + `criteria_factor` definition; hard-fail wording = \"`criteria_factor = 0` (**composite caps at 70**)\" with the memo's defensibility rationale. Acceptance Gherkin `:1181-1192` both hard-fail scenarios corrected; `match_score = 0` count across docs = **0**.\n- 45/25/30 + `match_score` DDL + `MatchScore` TS + old v2 Gherkin all under \"**Target-state scoring v2 (deferred — requires §3 data model)**\" (FRD `:1123`, `:1129-1130`, `:1132`, `:1150`, `:1167-1170`) with the conceptual→real name-mapping note (`match_score`/`chunk`/`lot`/`credential` ↔ `tender_lot_matches`/`sme_vault_chunks`/`tender_lots`/vault+org attrs) at `:1125`.\n- ARCH-002 `:9"
