[req] tool_call  call_413 edit({"newString":" * Gating: `compileTenderPackage` enforces the compile prerequisites (all\n * mandatory sections locked & human-reviewed, commercial pricing sign-off), and\n * returns the artifact to stream as an attachment. The bid is loaded bound to\n * the resolved tenant (`id` AND `org_id`), so a foreign-organization bid\n * resolves as `BID_NOT_FOUND` (404 semantics) rather than leaking another\n * tenant's proposal; the verified actor id is recorded on every export audit\n * row (success and gated alike).\n *\n * Persistence: on a successful compile the compiler (not this route) uploads\n * the artifact to the private `bid-exports` Storage bucket and stamps\n * `bid_proposals.final_docx_path` with the tenant-scoped object path\n * (best-effort). This route's streamed response is byte-identical whether or\n * not that persistence step succeeds; a gated export persists nothing.\n */","oldString":" * Gating: `compileTenderPackage` enforces the compile prerequisites (all\n * mandatory sections locked & human-reviewed, commercial pricing sign-off), and\n * returns the artifact to stream as an attachment. The bid is loaded bound to\n * the resolved tenant (`id` AND `org_id`), so a foreign-organization bid\n * resolves as `BID_NOT_FOUND` (404 semantics) rather than leaking another\n * tenant's proposal; the verified actor id is recorded on every export audit\n * row (success and gated alike).\n */","path":"/Users/sean/Desktop/TenderPulseNZ/src/app/api/bids/[bidId]/export/route.ts"})
