[req] tool_call  call_422 edit({"newString":" * Security:\n *   - Uses the service-role client on the server (never leaks to the browser).\n *   - If `CRON_SECRET` is set, requires `?secret=<CRON_SECRET>` so public\n *     requests cannot trigger an expensive ingest.\n *   - This route is EXEMPT from the middleware session wall: it matches the\n *     `/api/:path*` matcher but is passed through untouched by the single\n *     CRON early-allow in `src/middleware.ts` (before session verification),\n *     because a machine scheduler carries no browser session. The CRON_SECRET\n *     query gate above is therefore its ONLY access check — when a secret is\n *     configured and `?secret=` is missing/mismatched the route still returns\n *     401. If `CRON_SECRET` is unset the endpoint is open to anyone who can\n *     reach it (unchanged, documented behaviour; §4 will bind a real cadence\n *     scheduler to this URL).","oldString":" * Security:\n *   - Uses the service-role client on the server (never leaks to the browser).\n *   - If `CRON_SECRET` is set, requires `?secret=<CRON_SECRET>` so public\n *     requests cannot trigger an expensive ingest.","path":"/Users/sean/Desktop/TenderPulseNZ/src/app/api/cron/ingest-gets/route.ts"})
